                    "batchYear": 1975,
                    "photoUrl": null,
                    "birdOverride": "spotted-owlet"
                  },
                  "body": "Dear 2027 me, I went back in April for the first time since I left, and the thing that undid me was not the buildings at all. It was the sound, that particular quiet the valley has at four in the afternoon before.",
                  "images": [],
                  "songUrl": null,
