                    "batchYear": 1976,
                    "photoUrl": null,
                    "birdOverride": "spotted-owlet"
                  },
                  "body": "Dear 2027 me, It was the sound, that particular quiet the valley has at four in the afternoon before the birds start up again. I stood by the tamarind for a while feeling ridiculous about it. Nobody warned me that the dining hall would smell exactly the same. We drove up from Bangalore and got lost twice, which.",
